			title = "In the Present Day",
			text = [=[The {link:gnomeregan-exiles}exiles of Gnomeregan{/link} have not forgotten their city. From {link:tinker-town}Tinker Town{/link} they send volunteers back through its gates to rescue lost records, recover parts and salvage the machines they left behind. In {link:kharanos}Kharanos{/link}, two gnomes collect the city's poison in the hope of a cure. And the goblins of the {link:horde}Horde{/link} have learned that {link:mekgineer-thermaplugg}Thermaplugg{/link} is building a great machine, a rig better than any of their own, and they want its plans.]=],
